# Settings the production tasks read from SSM Parameter Store, one name per
# line. Each is stored as SecureString <SSM_PREFIX><name in lower case>, for
# example /argos/production/database_url. ECS reads them at task start, so the
# values never pass through GitHub.

DATABASE_URL
REDIS_URL
AMQP_URL
ENCRYPTION_KEY
SERVER_SESSION_SECRET
GITHUB_APP_ID
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY
GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET
